n also modify the code to make your own table pet! (Although most of the content supports the workshop, is no need to modify the code)<br>project address: github-LorisYounger/VPet<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Support Steam Workshop</h2><br>The game supports the Steam Workshop, you can make animations or interactions with other characters and table pets, and upload them to the creative workshop to share with more people.<br><br>The creative workshop supports adding/modifying the following content<br>The creative workshop supports adding/modifying the following content<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Table pet animation<br></li><li> Items/food/beverages, etc<br></li><li> Table pet work<br></li><li> Speech text<br></li><li> Theme<br></li><li> Code plugin - Add content to desktop pets by writing code<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Add new animation logic/display scheme (eg: l2d/spin, etc.)<br></li><li> Add new features (alarm clock/dashboard, etc.)<br></li><li> Almost omnipotent </li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feedback &amp; Suggestions &amp; Contact Us</h2><br>If you have any suggestions or comments, you can contact me in Steam store Comments/Community, Github Issue or email me",
